{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12736","headline":"会稽郡楼雪霁 · 张继","name":"会稽郡楼雪霁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江城昨夜雪如花，郢客登楼齐望华。\n夏禹坛前仍聚玉，西施浦上更飞沙。\n帘栊向晚寒风度，睥睨初晴落景斜。\n数处微明销不尽，湖山清映越人家。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张继","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12736.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12736","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}